          "name": "Sample Count",
          "type": "Byte&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Index",
          "type": "Int"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Float",
      "docs": "Smooth mouse movement, because mouse sampling doesn't match up with tick time.\n@note: if we got sample event for zero mouse samples (so we\ndidn't have to guess whether a 0 was caused by no sample occuring during the tick (at high frame rates) or because the mouse actually stopped)\n@param: aMouse is the mouse axis movement received from DirectInput\n@param: SampleCount is the number of mouse samples received from DirectInput\n@param: Index is 0 for X axis, 1 for Y axis\n@return the smoothed mouse axis movement"
    },
